  "prefLabel": "Env-A 306.02 Determination of Attainment of NO2 Standard",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 306.02 Determination of Attainment of NO2 Standard.\n\n(a) The annual primary standard for NO2 specified in Env-A 306.01 shall be deemed to be attained when the annual average concentration in a calendar year, as determined in accordance with 40 CFR 50 Appendix S, is less than or equal to 53 ppb.\n\n(b) The 1-hour primary standard for NO2 specified in Env-A 306.01 shall be deemed to be attained when the 3-year average of the annual 98th percentile of the daily maximum 1-hour average, as determined in accordance with 40 CFR 50 Appendix S, is less than or equal to 100 ppb.\n\n(c) The annual secondary standard specified in Env-A 306.01 shall be deemed to be attained when the annual arithmetic mean concentration in a calendar year is less than or equal to 0.053 ppm, rounded to 3 decimal places, as further described in 40 CFR 50.11(g).\n\nSource. #6227, eff 4-25-96; ss by #8054, eff 2-28-04; ss by #10173, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13382, eff 5-25-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a300.html"
}
